# What `docker build` may see, as an allowlist: everything is left out,
# then only what the build needs is let back in. A denylist would let in
# every file nobody thought of: .env, .git, bin/, a key file left in the
# folder. Render also copies secret files into the build folder; they stay
# out the same way.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
